🚀 Features

🌍 Location-Based Weather Search – Users can search weather details for any city.

🌡️ Real-Time Weather Data – Displays temperature, humidity, pressure, and wind speed.

☁️ Weather Conditions – Shows clear, cloudy, rainy, or storm conditions with icons.

📅 Weather Forecast – Displays upcoming weather predictions.

📱 Responsive Design – Works smoothly on desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.

⚡ Fast API Integration – Fetches live weather data using a weather API.

🎨 Modern UI – Clean and interactive user interface with smooth styling....

🛠️ Technologies Used

HTML5 – Structure of the application

CSS3 – Styling and responsive design

JavaScript (ES6) – Application logic and API handling

Weather API – Fetching real-time weather data

VS Code – Development environment

GitHub – Version control and project hosting
